OL,3,GNEWSALorry rumbles go on despite
OL,4,Abypass, villagers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers are urging lorry drivers to
OL,7,Fuse a new bypass instead of "blindly
OL,8,Ffollowing their sat navs" along an old
OL,9,Froute.
OL,11,FThe new A391 linking St Austell to the
OL,12,FA30 opened in May after three years of
OL,13,Fwork, diverting vehicles away from the
OL,14,Fvillages of Bugle and Stenalees.
OL,16,FHowever, residents said large lorries
OL,17,Fwere still passing through the
OL,18,Fvillages, causing congestion and
OL,19,F"never-ending" rumbling.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
