OL,3,GNEWSALorry rumbles go on despite
OL,4,Abypass, villagers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Road Haulage Association said it
OL,7,Fadvised hauliers to use HGV-specific
OL,8,Fsat navs, while Cornwall Council said
OL,9,Fit was continuing to monitor how
OL,10,Fdrivers used the road.
